==Battleground==
*1 [[Hatsune Miku XVI (Enemy)|Hatsune Miku XVI]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*15 [[MikuDoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*8 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 15~20 seconds<sup>450f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[MikuGory]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[MikuGory]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[MikuGory]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[MikuGory]] spawns after 108.33 seconds<sup>3,250f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Rush down Hatsune Miku XVI before the Hatsune Gories spawn, as it can be difficult dealing with the combination of the two. You are also able to rush Miku before all the Gories spawn, leaving the peons all by their lonesome. It is recommended to beat this after EoC Chapter 3 to make the rushing easier to do.

